    "text": "By Sindhura Venkatesh ,\n43 minutes ago The Amazing Race 38 moved from the Czech Republic to Hungary this week, where the ten remaining teams competed through a new set of mental and physical challenges in Budapest. The episode featured a Fast Forward puzzle, a Roadblock with horse carriage driving, and a Detour combining dance and juggling. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
